# Rafts: a yellow 8x2 platform floating on the liquid (rows 136-137),
# measured on the ROM 2026-09-24 in level 10 room 13, level 11 room 12 and
# level 12 room 14 (JAXAtari/tools/hero_gen, level_images CHARACTERS.md
# "Raft"). The recorded playthroughs ride it under the magma wall of each of
# those rooms. What the ROM does, frame by frame:
#   * it waits, still, until the hero comes to rest on it;
#   * then it carries him at 1 px/frame, back and forth between x 28 and
#     x 124, holding 2 frames at each end - whatever he presses: his own
#     LEFT/RIGHT does not move him along it, he rides at raft x + 1;
#   * it stops the frame he leaves it, and waits there;
#   * he lands on it from anywhere within 4 px of that riding spot, and
#     misses it (into the lethal liquid) from 8 px off;
#   * on every entry into the room it is put at the end the hero comes in
#     from (left edge -> x 28, right edge -> x 124); a death does not move it.
# x is the raft's left edge (RAM 40). Generated per level by
# tools/hero_gen/build_level.py, which also takes the raft out of the
# captured background - the engine draws it where it currently is.
